OL,3,AFrost, wind and rain forecast as autumn
OL,4,Awarmth fades for many
OL,5,
OL,6,FTemperatures are set to drop across
OL,7,Fmany parts of the UK as summerlike
OL,8,FSeptember warmth gives way to more
OL,9,Fautumnal conditions.
OL,11,FA weather front delivering outbreaks of
OL,12,Fheavy rain for some places on Wednesday
OL,13,Fwill move eastwards, leaving cooler air
OL,14,Fin its wake.
OL,16,FDaytime highs will be close to the late
OL,17,FSeptember average in most regions but
OL,18,Fsome cold nights are expected with
OL,19,Ffrost possible in a few locations on
OL,20,FThursday morning.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,0,100
